    L1  record
    L2    patient | clinical | lab_results | medications | billing
    L3      demographics | examination | treatments | panels | header | lines | totals | medication
    L4        personal | contact | insurance | periodontal | panel | line | prescriber | dispense_info
    L5          name | addresses | phones | primary | secondary | teeth | tests | adjustments
    L6            address | tooth | test | adjustment
    L7              coordinates | surfaces | xray | restorations | reference_range
